---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="For Savindi — My Heart, My Inspiration" description="A quiet corner of the internet dedicated to Savindi.">
  <div style="max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 1.5rem;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted, #888); margin: 0;">For Savindi</p>
      <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem; background: rgba(220, 100, 120, 0.1); color: #d65d75; border-radius: 99px; font-weight: 500;">Permanent Dedication</span>
    </div>
    
    <div class="wayrule" style="margin: 1rem 0 2.5rem 0; height: 1px; background: var(--border-color, #eaeaea);"></div>
    
    <h1 class="display h1" style="font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.8rem); line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800;">
      My favorite piece of art.
    </h1>

    <p class="lede" style="font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-main, #222); margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      Some people spend their lifetimes studying beauty, colors, and design. For me, I just look at you. You bring art, warmth, and brilliance into everything you touch.
    </p>

    <!-- Interactive / SVG Visualization: Sustainable Fashion & Creativity Constellation -->
    <div class="section-card" style="margin: 3rem 0; padding: 2.5rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(245, 240, 245, 0.6) 0%, rgba(255, 250, 245, 0.9) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(214, 93, 117, 0.2); border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);">
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <svg width="120" height="40" viewBox="0 0 120 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <path d="M10 20C30 5 40 35 60 20C80 5 90 35 110 20" stroke="#d65d75" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <circle cx="60" cy="20" r="4" fill="#d65d75" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 style="margin-top: 0; font-family: var(--font-display, serif); font-size: 1.5rem; text-align: center; color: #2c2c2c;">The Visionary & The Researcher</h3>
      <p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 1.2rem; color: #444;">
        Watching you pour your heart into your fashion PhD and your lifelong mission to make the industry sustainable is one of my greatest inspirations. You don't just dream of a better, greener world—you're actively researching and building it. 
      </p>
      <p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 1rem; color: #444;">
        Your passion for art, your sharp mind, and your fierce dedication to sustainability make you extraordinary in everything you do.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Interactive Stat / Quote Grid -->
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin: 3rem 0;">
      <div style="padding: 1.5rem; background: var(--bg-card, #fafafa); border: 1px solid var(--border-color, #eee); border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
        <div style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #d65d75; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">PhD</div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted, #666); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Sustainable Fashion Research</div>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 1.5rem; background: var(--bg-card, #fafafa); border: 1px solid var(--border-color, #eee); border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
        <div style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #d65d75; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">∞</div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted, #666); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Inspiration & Brilliance</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin: 3.5rem 0; padding: 2.5rem; text-align: center; border: 1px dashed var(--border-color, #ddd); border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.01);">
      <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted, #666); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.15em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Memories & Inside Jokes</p>
      <p style="font-style: italic; color: var(--text-secondary, #555); margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem;">
        "Here's to all our favorite adventures, quiet moments, and endless laughs."
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
